fe","term":"제품","zh":"产品，制品","audio":"/audio/60be380dfd52bdfeffe2.mp3","entryId":"70898","definition":"使用材料制作物品；或指经此做出来的物品。","pronunciation":["제ː품"]},{"id":"f7c6efa694aaef95","term":"그렇다","zh":"那样","audio":"/audio/f7c6efa694aaef9559bd.mp3","entryId":"61178","definition":"表示状态、样子、性质等与此相同。","pronunciation":["그러타"]},{"id":"1af2aeb1be04021c","term":"많이","zh":"多","audio":"/audio/1af2aeb1be04021c7be5.mp3","entryId":"66030","definition":"数、量、程度等超过一定标准地。","pronunciation":["마ː니"]},{"id":"5f104909fa8ff0fa","term":"팔리다","zh":"被卖掉，被卖出","audio":"/audio/5f104909fa8ff0fa0801.mp3","entryId":"71483","definition":"收取钱财后，物品或权利被交给对方或劳动力等被提供。","pronunciation":["팔리다"]}],"audio":"/audio/f7efbddb77946fbf67d6.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n25686-1-8-2","ko":"가격 경쟁력이 뛰어나서 그런 것 같아요.","zh":"大概是因为它的价格很有竞争力吧。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"가격","meaning":"价格，价钱","explanation":"가격：价格，价钱","readings":[{"term":"가격","audio":"/audio/38c1b40757a204e578e9.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62450","senseId":"1","lemma":"가격","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"가격","audio":"/audio/38c1b40757a204e578e9.mp3"}},{"text":"경쟁력이","meaning":"竞争力","explanation":"경쟁력：竞争力；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"경쟁력","audio":"/audio/770f3a54d8a0cd74bec0.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"25686","senseId":"1","lemma":"경쟁력","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"경쟁력이","audio":"/audio/91994ad96df6e7e83a2b.mp3"}},{"text":"뛰어나서","meaning":"超群，杰出","explanation":"뛰어나다：超群，杰出；어서：连接原因与结果，或前后相接的动作。","readings":[{"term":"뛰어나다","audio":"/audio/d7b1acf8ccdbda574e71.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"14445","senseId":"1","lemma":"뛰어나다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"뛰어나서","audio":"/audio/7ae98c2247de91570a15.mp3"}},{"text":"그런","meaning":"那种，那样","explanation":"그런：那种，那样","readings":[{"term":"그런","audio":"/audio/d14f5bfb24390ed9c4da.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60341","senseId":"1","lemma":"그런","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"그런","audio":"/audio/d14f5bfb24390ed9c4da.mp3"}},{"text":"것","meaning":"表示某种行为、状态或事情。","explanation":"것：表示某种行为、状态或事情。","readings":[{"term":"것","audio":"/audio/1443a6c090b122289ad7.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62835","senseId":"4","lemma":"것","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"것","audio":"/audio/1443a6c090b122289ad7.mp3"}},{"text":"같아요.","meaning":"好像，可能","explanation":"같다：好像，可能；어요：礼貌句末；可随语调表示陈述或询问。","readings":[{"term":"같다","audio":"/audio/962ae18a075d06e2b7fd.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62076","senseId":"8","lemma":"같다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"같아요","audio":"/audio/d27f58354e12c6dc5616.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"38c1b40757a204e5","term":"가격","zh":"价格，价钱","audio":"/audio/38c1b40757a204e578e9.mp3","entryId":"62450","definition":"用钱表示的物品的价值。","pronunciation":["가격"]},{"id":"770f3a54d8a0cd74","term":"경쟁력","zh":"竞争力","audio":"/audio/770f3a54d8a0cd74bec0.mp3","entryId":"25686","definition":"可以竞争的力量或能力。","pronunciation":["경ː쟁녁"]},{"id":"d7b1acf8ccdbda57","term":"뛰어나다","zh":"超群，杰出","audio":"/audio/d7b1acf8ccdbda574e71.mp3","entryId":"14445","definition":"能力等超过众人，或比别人优秀。","pronunciation":["뛰어나다","뛰여나다"]},{"id":"d14f5bfb24390ed9","term":"그런","zh":"那种，那样","audio":"/audio/d14f5bfb24390ed9c4da.mp3","entryId":"60341","definition":"状态、模样、性质等那个样子的。","pronunciation":["그런"]},{"id":"1443a6c090b12228","term":"것","zh":"表示某种行为、状态或事情。","audio":"/audio/1443a6c090b122289ad7.mp3","entryId":"62835","definition":"表示某种行为、状态或事情。","pronunciation":["걷"]},{"id":"962ae18a075d06e2","term":"같다","zh":"好像，可能","audio":"/audio/962ae18a075d06e2b7fd.mp3","entryId":"62076","definition":"推测出结果。","pronunciation":["갇따"]}],"audio":"/audio/b4fae21ef619851cf84a.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":2.762,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=25686","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"1","